{"sections":[{"slug":"平坦环同态","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"平坦环同态"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">平坦环同态</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"平坦环同态"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称环同态</span> $A\\to B$ <span lang=\"zh\">是平坦的是指</span>\n$$\r\n{-}\\otimes B\\colon B\\mathsf {Mod}\\to A\\mathsf {Mod}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">正合</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">此时我们也称</span> $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上平坦</span> (flat over $A$).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平坦概形态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平坦概形态射</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}